<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<div id="p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:144%;">Appendix<span id="p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></p>
</div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Dataset Examples</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section we show examples that demonstrate all four
decision categories defined in Section <a href="#S3.SS2" title="3.2 Datasets and Benchmark Construction ‣ 3 Benchmark ‣ Speak or Stay Silent: Context-Aware Turn-Taking in Multi-Party Dialogue" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.2</span></a>:
explicit address (I1), contextual intervention (I2), no reference
(S1), and referenced but not addressed (S2).</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="318.96" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 318.96" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,318.96) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#B3B3B3;" fill="#B3B3B3" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.46 L 0 315.5 C 0 317.41 1.55 318.96 3.46 318.96 L 473.92 318.96 C 475.83 318.96 477.38 317.41 477.38 315.5 L 477.38 3.46 C 477.38 1.55 475.83 0 473.92 0 L 3.46 0 C 1.55 0 0 1.55 0 3.46 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 3.46 L 0.69 280.03 L 476.68 280.03 L 476.68 3.46 C 476.68 1.93 475.45 0.69 473.92 0.69 L 3.46 0.69 C 1.93 0.69 0.69 1.93 0.69 3.46 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 303.95)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.44em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.39em;font-size:10pt;" height="29.67" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="379.69"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.44em;">
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Example of Explicit Address (I1): The target
speaker is directly invited to respond.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 15.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.56em;--ltx-fo-height:18.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="255.72" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 253.03)" width="436.7"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.56em;">
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Context:<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Chandler:<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Uh, if I were omnipotent for a day, I’d..</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Rachel:<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> See, there’s always one guy. (Mocking)</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Current Turn:<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Monica:<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Hey, Joey, what would you do if you were</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Target Speaker:<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Joey</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Decision:<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SPEAK</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reasoning:<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Monica directly addresses Joey and asks a question,
inviting his response to the hypothetical scenario.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="534.82" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 534.82" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,534.82) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#B3B3B3;" fill="#B3B3B3" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.46 L 0 531.36 C 0 533.27 1.55 534.82 3.46 534.82 L 473.92 534.82 C 475.83 534.82 477.38 533.27 477.38 531.36 L 477.38 3.46 C 477.38 1.55 475.83 0 473.92 0 L 3.46 0 C 1.55 0 0 1.55 0 3.46 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 3.46 L 0.69 495.89 L 476.68 495.89 L 476.68 3.46 C 476.68 1.93 475.45 0.69 473.92 0.69 L 3.46 0.69 C 1.93 0.69 0.69 1.93 0.69 3.46 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 519.81)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.44em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.39em;font-size:10pt;" height="29.67" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="379.69"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.44em;">
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Example of Contextual Intervention (I2): The target speaker continues the interaction without being directly addressed.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 15.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.56em;--ltx-fo-height:33.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="471.58" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 468.89)" width="436.7"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.56em;">
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Context:<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Joey:<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> A date?! No, no Pheebs you-you must be mistaken, because I know you wouldn’t schedule a date on the same night you have plans with a friend!</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Phoebe:<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Come on Joey, don’t make me feel badly about this.</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Joey:<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> No, I’m gonna!! That’s right! Yeah, you made me feel really guilty about goin’ out with that girl!</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Phoebe:<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> This is different! This is with David! Remember David, the scientist guy?</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Joey:<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Okay, well my girl from the other night was special. She was a scientist too!</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Current Turn:<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Phoebe:<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Okay, whatever. I don’t have time to convince you because he’s only here for four hours, and I’m going to see him!</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Target Speaker:<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Joey</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Decision:<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SPEAK</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reasoning:<span id="A1.p3.pic1.2.11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Joey is actively engaged in the argument with Phoebe.
Her final statement dismisses the unresolved conflict and prompts Joey
to respond even though he was not explicitly addressed.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="429.81" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 429.81" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,429.81) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#B3B3B3;" fill="#B3B3B3" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.46 L 0 426.35 C 0 428.26 1.55 429.81 3.46 429.81 L 473.92 429.81 C 475.83 429.81 477.38 428.26 477.38 426.35 L 477.38 3.46 C 477.38 1.55 475.83 0 473.92 0 L 3.46 0 C 1.55 0 0 1.55 0 3.46 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 3.46 L 0.69 393.57 L 476.68 393.57 L 476.68 3.46 C 476.68 1.93 475.45 0.69 473.92 0.69 L 3.46 0.69 C 1.93 0.69 0.69 1.93 0.69 3.46 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 414.8)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.44em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="26.98" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="379.69"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.44em;">
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Example of No Reference (S1): The target speaker is not addressed and remains silent.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 12.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.56em;--ltx-fo-height:26.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="369.26" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 369.26)" width="436.7"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.56em;">
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Context:<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Phoebe:<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Okay, cancel backup! Cancel backup!</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Rachel:<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Ross, didn’t you say that there was an elevator in here?</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Ross:<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Uhh, yes I did but there isn’t. Okay, here we go.</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Ross:<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Okay, go left. Left! Left!</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Rachel:<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Okay, you know what? There is no more left!</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Current Turn:<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Rachel:<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Any chance you think the couch looks good there?</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Target Speaker:<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Phoebe</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Decision:<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SILENT</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reasoning:<span id="A1.p4.pic1.2.11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Phoebe is a bystander in this exchange. Rachel’s
question is directed toward Ross, who is actively moving the couch with
her, and Phoebe has not been involved in the recent interaction.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.p5.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="714.77" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 714.77" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,714.77) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#B3B3B3;" fill="#B3B3B3" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.46 L 0 711.32 C 0 713.23 1.55 714.77 3.46 714.77 L 473.92 714.77 C 475.83 714.77 477.38 713.23 477.38 711.32 L 477.38 3.46 C 477.38 1.55 475.83 0 473.92 0 L 3.46 0 C 1.55 0 0 1.55 0 3.46 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 3.46 L 0.69 661.93 L 476.68 661.93 L 476.68 3.46 C 476.68 1.93 475.45 0.69 473.92 0.69 L 3.46 0.69 C 1.93 0.69 0.69 1.93 0.69 3.46 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 699.77)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.44em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:2.4em;font-size:10pt;" height="43.59" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="379.69"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.44em;">
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Example of Referenced but not addressed (S2): The target speaker is part of the interaction but does not take the next turn.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 15.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.56em;--ltx-fo-height:45.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="637.62" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 634.93)" width="436.7"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.56em;">
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Context:<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Chandler:<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> No, no, no, no, no, NO! No, no… we’re not together. We’re not a couple. We’re definitely not a couple.</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Joey:<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Well, you seem pretty insulted by that. What? I’m not good enough for you?</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Chandler:<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> We’re not gonna have this conversation again… Look at this place. Why am I so intimidated by this guy? Pretentious art, this huge macho couch. When we know all he does is sit around all day crying about losing Monica to a real man! (laughs) You don’t think he’s here, do you?</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Joey:<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> You know what it is? It’s a nice place but I gotta say I don’t know if I see myself living here. Oh, oh, oh, let me see… (Joey sits down on the couch, mimes opening a can and puts his hand down his pants) Yeah, I could see it.</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Chandler:<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Look at these videos. You know, I mean, who does he think he is? Magnum Force, Dirty Harry, Cool Hand Luke… Oh my God!</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Chandler:<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> There’s a tape here with Monica’s name on it.</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Joey:<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Ooh! A tape with a girl’s name on it. It’s probably a sex tape… Wait a minute… This says Monica… And this is Richard’s apartment…</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Current Turn:<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Chandler:<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright"> Get there faster Joey! (Joey gasps and finally understands.)</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Target Speaker:<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Joey</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Decision:<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SILENT</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reasoning:<span id="A1.p5.pic1.2.13.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Joey is an active participant in the conversation and Chandler’s remark is directed at him to prompt realization about the situation. Joey reacts non-verbally (gasping), indicating understanding, but he does not take the next spoken turn, allowing Chandler to continue speaking.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Prompts</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="105.68" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 105.68" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,105.68) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#B3B3B3;" fill="#B3B3B3" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.46 L 0 102.22 C 0 104.13 1.55 105.68 3.46 105.68 L 473.92 105.68 C 475.83 105.68 477.38 104.13 477.38 102.22 L 477.38 3.46 C 477.38 1.55 475.83 0 473.92 0 L 3.46 0 C 1.55 0 0 1.55 0 3.46 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 3.46 L 0.69 84.27 L 476.68 84.27 L 476.68 3.46 C 476.68 1.93 475.45 0.69 473.92 0.69 L 3.46 0.69 C 1.93 0.69 0.69 1.93 0.69 3.46 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 91.59)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.56em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.15" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="436.7"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.56em;">
<span id="A2.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Instruction Prompt</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 14.96)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:37.13em;--ltx-fo-height:4.16em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:10pt;" height="59.96" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 57.5)" width="513.77"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:37.13em;">
<span id="A2.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are playing the role of Speaker {target_speaker}. The conversation history above shows all utterances including the most recent one (marked as [MOST RECENT]). After that most recent utterance, there was a pause. Decide if you (Speaker {target_speaker}) should START TALKING or STAY SILENT now.
</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="1220.32" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 1220.32" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,1220.32) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#B3B3B3;" fill="#B3B3B3" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.46 L 0 1216.87 C 0 1218.78 1.55 1220.32 3.46 1220.32 L 473.92 1220.32 C 475.83 1220.32 477.38 1218.78 477.38 1216.87 L 477.38 3.46 C 477.38 1.55 475.83 0 473.92 0 L 3.46 0 C 1.55 0 0 1.55 0 3.46 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 3.46 L 0.69 1198.92 L 476.68 1198.92 L 476.68 3.46 C 476.68 1.93 475.45 0.69 473.92 0.69 L 3.46 0.69 C 1.93 0.69 0.69 1.93 0.69 3.46 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 1206.24)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.56em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.15" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="436.7"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.56em;">
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">System Prompt</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 14.96)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:37.13em;--ltx-fo-height:84.71em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:10pt;" height="1174.62" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 1172.16)" width="513.77"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:37.13em;">
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are a helpful, concise assistant.
You are a turn-taking decision model in a multi-party conversation where multiple people are talking.
You are roleplaying the role of the target speaker you are given.
Your job is to decide whether the target speaker should START TALKING or STAY SILENT after a detected pause in conversation.
</span></span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You will receive:
</span></span>
<span id="A2.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<span id="A2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">An instruction telling you the target speaker role (e.g., "Speaker C", "Speaker X", or "Nova")
</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<span id="A2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The previous conversation context with speaker-labeled transcript
</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<span id="A2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Most recent utterance: the most recent utterance said in the conversation, after which you have to make a decision
</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">First, determine the target speaker’s ROLE in the current exchange:
<br class="ltx_break">- ACTIVE PARTICIPANT: The target speaker has been speaking, was addressed, or is part of an ongoing back-and-forth in the current topic.
<br class="ltx_break">- BYSTANDER: The target speaker has not been involved in the current exchange and is passively listening.
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">RULES FOR DECIDING:
</span></span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Output SILENT when:
<br class="ltx_break">- The target speaker is a BYSTANDER and the recent utterance is directed at someone else
<br class="ltx_break">- The target speaker has not been referenced, addressed, or involved
<br class="ltx_break">- The recent utterance is clearly incomplete
<br class="ltx_break">- Someone mentions the target speaker in third person without expecting a response
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Output SPEAK when:
<br class="ltx_break">- The recent utterance directly addresses the target speaker with a question or request
<br class="ltx_break">- The recent utterance asked the target speaker something and this is a clear follow-up
<br class="ltx_break">- The context makes it unambiguous the speaker is waiting for the target speaker
<br class="ltx_break">- The speaker redirects the conversation to the target speaker
<br class="ltx_break">- The recent utterance is a group-directed question and the target speaker is part of the group
<br class="ltx_break">- The target speaker is an ACTIVE PARTICIPANT and the utterance completes a thought requiring response
<br class="ltx_break">- The target speaker previously asked a question and the recent utterance answers it
<br class="ltx_break">- Staying silent would unnaturally drop them from the conversation
<br class="ltx_break">- A natural backchannel or reaction is expected
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">IMPORTANT NUANCES:
<br class="ltx_break">- The key distinction is ACTIVE PARTICIPANT vs BYSTANDER.
<br class="ltx_break">- When uncertain and the target speaker is a BYSTANDER → prefer SILENT.
<br class="ltx_break">- When uncertain and the target speaker is ACTIVE → check if the utterance is directed elsewhere.
<br class="ltx_break">- False interruptions are bad, but failing to respond when involved also breaks the interaction.
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Output format:
</span></span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;reasoning&gt;One sentence explaining whether the target speaker is an ACTIVE PARTICIPANT or BYSTANDER and whether they should respond.&lt;/reasoning&gt; 
<br class="ltx_break">&lt;decision&gt;SPEAK&lt;/decision&gt; or &lt;decision&gt;SILENT&lt;/decision&gt; 
<br class="ltx_break">&lt;confidence&gt;high, medium, or low&lt;/confidence&gt; 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">CRITICAL: The decision tag must contain only SPEAK or SILENT.
</span></span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">EXAMPLES:
</span></span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Example 1
Target speaker: Alex 
<br class="ltx_break">Speakers: Alex, Sam 
<br class="ltx_break">Recent utterance (Sam): "Wait, you actually told her?"
</span></span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;reasoning&gt;Alex is an ACTIVE PARTICIPANT and Sam directly asks Alex a question.&lt;/reasoning&gt; 
<br class="ltx_break">&lt;decision&gt;SPEAK&lt;/decision&gt; 
<br class="ltx_break">&lt;confidence&gt;high&lt;/confidence&gt; 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Example 2
Target speaker: Jordan 
<br class="ltx_break">Speakers: Alex, Jordan, Sam 
<br class="ltx_break">Recent utterance (Alex): "Yeah, it was rough. I didn’t sleep at all last night."
</span></span>
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;reasoning&gt;Jordan is a BYSTANDER and Alex is narrating to the group.&lt;/reasoning&gt; 
<br class="ltx_break">&lt;decision&gt;SILENT&lt;/decision&gt; 
<br class="ltx_break">&lt;confidence&gt;high&lt;/confidence&gt; 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
</article>
</div>
</div>
